# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# The European steel profiles as linear types: IPE, IPN, HEA, HEB, HEM
# (EN 10365, DIN 1025), UPN, UPE (EN 10365, DIN 1026), equal and unequal
# angles (EN 10056-1), T sections (EN 10055), square, rectangular and
# circular hollow sections (EN 10210), each with its IFC profile
# (`bim_profiles.dl`: an I, U, L, T shape, a hollow section; IPN's tapered
# flanges as parallel ones), named by its designation ("HEA 200",
# "L 80x80x8", "CHS 114.3x5"), of steel, with the NL-SfB code 28.1 (main
# load-bearing structure). Beams take every profile; the H sections and
# hollow sections are columns too. Dimensions in millimetres: depth h,
# width b, web tw, flange tf and root radius r (an angle's thickness as tw
# and tf; a hollow section's wall as tw and its outer corner radius, 1.5 t,
# as tf).
import model/bim_profiles.dl
import formats/bim_file.dl

# The table, one profile a record: series, nominal size (0 when the
# designation is its dimensions), profile kind, h, b, tw, tf, r, and 1 when
# it is a column profile too.
function the bim steel profile table:
    execute:
        set tableLines to an empty list of a string
        append (the string form of "1 80 1 80 46 3.8 5.2 5 0;1 100 1 100 55 4.1 5.7 7 0;1 120 1 120 64 4.4 6.3 7 0;1 140 1 140 73 4.7 6.9 7 0;1 160 1 160 82 5 7.4 9 0;1 180 1 180 91 5.3 8 9 0;1 200 1 200 100 5.6 8.5 12 0;1 220 1 220 110 5.9 9.2 12 0;1 240 1 240 120 6.2 9.8 15 0;1 270 1 270 135 6.6 10.2 15 0;1 300 1 300 150 7.1 10.7 15 0;1 330 1 330 160 7.5 11.5 18 0") to tableLines
        append (the string form of "1 360 1 360 170 8 12.7 18 0;1 400 1 400 180 8.6 13.5 21 0;1 450 1 450 190 9.4 14.6 21 0;1 500 1 500 200 10.2 16 21 0;1 550 1 550 210 11.1 17.2 24 0;1 600 1 600 220 12 19 24 0;2 80 1 80 42 3.9 5.9 3.9 0;2 100 1 100 50 4.5 6.8 4.5 0;2 120 1 120 58 5.1 7.7 5.1 0;2 140 1 140 66 5.7 8.6 5.7 0;2 160 1 160 74 6.3 9.5 6.3 0;2 180 1 180 82 6.9 10.4 6.9 0") to tableLines
        append (the string form of "2 200 1 200 90 7.5 11.3 7.5 0;2 220 1 220 98 8.1 12.2 8.1 0;2 240 1 240 106 8.7 13.1 8.7 0;2 260 1 260 113 9.4 14.1 9.4 0;2 280 1 280 119 10.1 15.2 10.1 0;2 300 1 300 125 10.8 16.2 10.8 0;2 320 1 320 131 11.5 17.3 11.5 0;2 340 1 340 137 12.2 18.3 12.2 0;2 360 1 360 143 13 19.5 13 0;2 380 1 380 149 13.7 20.5 13.7 0;2 400 1 400 155 14.4 21.6 14.4 0;2 450 1 450 170 16.2 24.3 16.2 0") to tableLines
        append (the string form of "2 500 1 500 185 18 27 18 0;2 550 1 550 200 19 30 19 0;2 600 1 600 215 21.6 32.4 21.6 0;3 100 1 96 100 5 8 12 1;3 120 1 114 120 5 8 12 1;3 140 1 133 140 5.5 8.5 12 1;3 160 1 152 160 6 9 15 1;3 180 1 171 180 6 9.5 15 1;3 200 1 190 200 6.5 10 18 1;3 220 1 210 220 7 11 18 1;3 240 1 230 240 7.5 12 21 1;3 260 1 250 260 7.5 12.5 24 1") to tableLines
        append (the string form of "3 280 1 270 280 8 13 24 1;3 300 1 290 300 8.5 14 27 1;3 320 1 310 300 9 15.5 27 1;3 340 1 330 300 9.5 16.5 27 1;3 360 1 350 300 10 17.5 27 1;3 400 1 390 300 11 19 27 1;3 450 1 440 300 11.5 21 27 1;3 500 1 490 300 12 23 27 1;3 550 1 540 300 12.5 24 27 1;3 600 1 590 300 13 25 27 1;3 650 1 640 300 13.5 26 27 1;3 700 1 690 300 14.5 27 27 1") to tableLines
